 239:layer1/prim_fbsb.c **** 	/* If we call tdma_sched_reset(), which is only needed if there
 240:layer1/prim_fbsb.c **** 	 * are further l1s_sbdet_resp() scheduled, we will bring
 241:layer1/prim_fbsb.c **** 	 * dsp_api.db_r and dsp_api.db_w out of sync because we changed
 242:layer1/prim_fbsb.c **** 	 * dsp_api.db_w for l1s_sbdet_cmd() and canceled
 243:layer1/prim_fbsb.c **** 	 * l1s_sbdet_resp() which would change dsp_api.db_r. The DSP
 244:layer1/prim_fbsb.c **** 	 * however expects dsp_api.db_w and dsp_api.db_r to be in sync
